Hmmmmm, I mud a lot too, and I got this idea:

I always notice that the combat can be a bit boring, although the messages
in 3.1 seem to be more verbose, but I have not yet been priveliged enough
to play it yet.  What I was thinking was perhaps, instead of this:

The Olog-Hai hits! --more-- The Olog-Hai hits! --more--
You die... --more--

you could see this:

The Olog-Hai obliterates you! --more-- The Olog-Hai massacres you! --more--
You die... --more--

This could be based upon how much % of damage each attack did to your maxhp,
so you could tell offhand how hard you or a monster hits.

The kobold tickles you! --more-- The kobold scratches you! --more--
Orcus vaporizes you! --more--
You die... --more--

and such...Just and idea, what do you think?


